cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this method, code or data, please cite it as below."
title: "bide-eta: bus arrival prediction from position-only real-time feeds and interpolated timetables"
abstract: >-
  Reference implementation, test vectors, public evaluator and data of the arrival prediction method used by the
  Bizkaibus+ app (Bide+). The method works with timetable differences, learns the travel time of every segment by
  time band with shrunk medians and predicts in three layers with explicit abstention rules.
